//       Year's resolutions fail (a magazine article), Sofia's message to Anna; Sofia's B1 exam course — a consultation
//       with her teacher Maret, a voice message and a study plan in a letter.
//   072 the family chat: five-year goals and Helgi's wishes; B1 grammar: the jussive (möönev kõneviis) for recognition —
